      "source_text": "毕竟……传记类作品中记载着不少虚构的轶事，\r\n为了不让大家将其与史实弄混，所以我将它们从历史区分出来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "841a85ebf61a7de84dfb1431ddf9cece8d1aa07fd9d2e6d3d74fe9af531e46f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047001.json",
      "json_path": [
