    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7e3cc0886d69d652a3d43fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，但我喜欢的正是这些虚构内容哦！\r\n能让人们为其创作逸话，正是后世对其评价之高的证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbc2f8439a927cfb5f0bcae3a8fa6b59fcbcec0427c2f464b30402e1ae18f729",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb5bfdaa2bb3c3807fdb605b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88a8c0c0f6e7841e32f00572",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为人们所仰慕、永远留存于人们的记忆之中……\r\n这样的存在才称得上是“英雄”！\r\n所以，我——",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5cda29d9d4717bd8ea7589b3ba0c5673d8f3188242e836fc217026f3140a153",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53fa531a38396959e2186a17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你很喜欢英雄的话题呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6912fd9aacf2f1ad5b47d9e97d99b6fc22a8a0cc69a2563636f564c44f53e8a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7821ca221950c95306bc07f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你很喜欢英雄的话题呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6912fd9aacf2f1ad5b47d9e97d99b6fc22a8a0cc69a2563636f564c44f53e8a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047001.json",
      "json_path": [
